333		/**
334		 * Already-completed lessons that gained new content since the learner
335		 * finished them (e.g. a symbol category wired up after the fact), scoped
336		 * down to just the new items so `LessonIntro` can walk through them
337		 * without repeating what was already taught.
338		 */
